+
+<a id="ref2"></a>2. Unger CA, Walters MD. "Female clitoral priapism: an over-the-counter option for management." *J Sex Med.* 2014;11(9):2354-2356. doi:[10.1111/jsm.12465](https://doi.org/10.1111/jsm.12465)
+
+<a id="ref3"></a>3. Nguyen J, Chin JJ, Blalock M. "Probable drug-induced clitoral priapism due to potentiating effects of pregabalin and duloxetine." *Am J Health Syst Pharm.* 2023;80(1):22-26. doi:[10.1093/ajhp/zxac257](https://doi.org/10.1093/ajhp/zxac257)
+
+<a id="ref4"></a>4. Elhassan YS, Hawley JM, Cussen L, et al. "Society for Endocrinology Clinical Practice Guideline for the Evaluation of Androgen Excess in Women." *Clin Endocrinol (Oxf).* 2025;103(4):540-566. doi:[10.1111/cen.15265](https://doi.org/10.1111/cen.15265)
+
