+
+<a id="ref6"></a>6. Golden E, Cooke S, Butler E, Gregg L, Gomez E. "Under the hood: vulvar anatomy and pathology with a focus on MRI." *Abdom Radiol (NY).* 2026;51(4):2106-2124. doi:[10.1007/s00261-025-05179-1](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00261-025-05179-1)
