+# Clitoris pages — Codex report (October 19, 2026)
+
+## Files changed
+
+- New `docs/01-foundations/anatomy-physiology/genitalia/clitoris.mdx`: anatomy, terminology, histology, clitourethrovaginal relationships, neurovascular operative planes, embryology, physiology, imaging, clinical links, BackTable podcast, and OMGYES resource.
+- New `docs/03-clinical-conditions/03g-genital-scrotal/clitoral-disorders.mdx`: clitorodynia, priapism, enlargement evaluation, and epidermal inclusion cysts.
+- Expanded `docs/03-clinical-conditions/03g-genital-scrotal/clitoral-phimosis.mdx`: keratin pearls, office selection/anesthesia/endpoint, LS and hypoestrogenic maintenance, additional outcomes, and sharp-separation barrier cases. Existing material retained.
+- Cross-link only in `docs/01-foundations/anatomy-physiology/genitalia/female-external-genitalia.mdx`. The genitalia category is autogenerated and has no page-list index; clitoral-disorders has inbound links from both new anatomy and existing phimosis pages.
+
+## Reference verification
+
+Every DOI below resolved to the named article; author, volume year, and topic were matched against the PubMed record or publisher page. Values in the text were checked against the abstract or available full text. References repeated on two pages are listed in both page groups for traceability.
+
